      "kind": "correctness",
      "harm": "If a child tx spends a lookahead parent later in the block, prefix rescan misses the child and leaves the parent output classified as unspent",
      "quote": "The parent output can remain classified as unspent, leaving the wallet balance incorrect until another rescan.",
      "blocking": false,
      "status": "open",
