      "harm": "A cascading receive past scan_end that becomes wallet-relevant only after the prefix pass recovers an earlier tx is missed, leaving the wallet balance short",
      "quote": "A receive only becomes the wallet's once the prefix pass recovers an earlier one, and it sits past scan_end. The balance comes out 0.00050000 short.",
